    "title": "See Karol G full Coachella 2026 setlist",
    "text": "COACHELLAEverything Coachella 2026 headliner Karol G sang during her historic set Ema SasicPalm Springs Desert SunApril 13, 2026Updated April 14, 2026, 9:43 a.m. PTIt was a historic night for Colombian singer Karol G, who became the first Latina to headline the Coachella Valley Music and Arts Festival on Sunday, April 12.Latinx pride was front and center on the Coachella Stage, along with plenty of surprises throughout the night.Here's everything Karol G sang during her Weekend 1 performance:\"Latina Foreva\"“Un Gatita Me Llamo”“Oki Doki”“Tá OK”\"El Makinon\" (with special guest Mariah Angeliq)“S91”\"Que rico mambo\" (band only)“Tropicoqueta”“Papasito”“Son de la Negra” (performed by an all-female mariachi group)“Ese Hombre Es Malo”“Mamiii” (with special guest Becky G)“A Su Boca La Amo (Interlude)”“Gatúbela”\"Bandida Entrenada\"\"Ojos Ferrari\"\"Pam Pam\" (cover of Wisin & Yandel featuring special guest Wisin)\"Saoco\" (cover of Wisin & Yandel featuring special guest Wisin)\"Mayor Que Oh\" (cover of Baby Ranks, Daddy Yankee, Tonny Tún Tún, Wisin, Yandel & Héctor featuring special guest Wisin)\"Rakata\" (cover of Wisin & Yandel featuring special guest Wisin)\"Ivonny Bonita\"\"TQG\"\"Amargura\"\"Tusa\"\"Si Antes Te Hubiera Conocido\"\"Provenza\"Ema Sasic covers entertainment and health in the Coachella Valley. Reach her at ema.sasic@desertsun.com or on Twitter @ema_sasic.",
